-- Section 3 inputs.
GIVEN pair IS A `Two businesses`
      sensitive IS A BOOLEAN
      how IS A `How the information is shared`
      explicit IS A BOOLEAN
      effect IS A `Finding on the exchange's effect`
      intended IS A BOOLEAN
      recommendations IS A BOOLEAN
      strict IS A BOOLEAN
      shared IS A BOOLEAN
      discretion IS A BOOLEAN
      share IS A BOOLEAN
      jv IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Information exchange`
`ind exchange` MEANS `Information exchange` WITH
    `the businesses` IS pair
    `the information is competitively sensitive information about compensation or other terms or conditions of employment` IS sensitive
    `how the information is shared` IS how
    `the exchange is explicit rather than implied from the conduct of the parties` IS explicit
    `the finding on the exchange's effect` IS effect
    `the effect was intended` IS intended
    `the exchange is used to generate wage or other benefit recommendations` IS recommendations
    `the exchange requires the businesses to strictly adhere to the recommendations` IS strict
    `the businesses agree to use shared wage recommendations, lists, calculations, or algorithms` IS shared
    `the participants retain some discretion or cheat on the agreement` IS discretion
    `the businesses agree to share information about wages or other terms of employment` IS share
    `the businesses are parties to a legitimate transaction or a joint venture or other collaborative activity` IS jv

`ind has effect` MEANS `the exchange has, or is likely to have, an anticompetitive effect`
`ind direct` MEANS `directly between the businesses`

-- Positional order: pair, sensitive, how, explicit, effect, intended, recommendations,
-- strict, shared, discretion, share, jv.
`ind exchange, effect` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `ind direct` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, effect unintended` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `ind direct` TRUE `ind has effect` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, implied` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `ind direct` FALSE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, no effect` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `ind direct` TRUE `the exchange neither has nor is likely to have an anticompetitive effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, effect unassessed` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `ind direct` TRUE `the exchange's effect has not been assessed` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, via algorithm` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `through an algorithm or other software, or through a third party's tool or product` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, via intermediary` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `through a third party or intermediary` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, non-binding recommendations` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `through an algorithm or other software, or through a third party's tool or product` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, shared recommendations with discretion` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` TRUE `through an algorithm or other software, or through a third party's tool or product` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, in a joint venture` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind JV partners` TRUE `ind direct` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE
`ind exchange, not sensitive` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind rivals` FALSE `ind direct` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind exchange, non-rivals` MEANS `ind exchange` `ind non-rivals` TRUE `ind direct` TRUE `ind has effect` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

-- Sections 4 and 5 inputs.
GIVEN kind IS A `Kind of employment term`
      switching IS A BOOLEAN
      starting IS A BOOLEAN
      limits IS A BOOLEAN
      prevents IS A BOOLEAN
      industry IS A BOOLEAN
      chills IS A BOOLEAN
      impedes IS A BOOLEAN
      indications IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Employment term`
`ind term` MEANS `Employment term` WITH
    `the kind of term` IS kind
    `it restricts the worker from switching jobs` IS switching
    `it restricts the worker from starting a competing business` IS starting
    `it limits competition` IS limits
    `it functions to prevent the worker from seeking, accepting or working in another job, or from starting a business` IS prevents
    `it prohibits disclosure of any information that is usable in or relates to an industry` IS industry
    `it is worded so broadly as to suggest that workers who report potential violations of law, or who cooperate with a government investigation, could face lawsuits and adverse employment consequences` IS chills
    `it impedes worker mobility or otherwise undermines competition` IS impedes
    `there are indications that it is harming competition` IS indications

`ind NDA` MEANS `a non-disclosure agreement`
`ind TRAP` MEANS `a training repayment agreement provision`
`ind client non-solicit` MEANS `a non-solicitation agreement that prohibits the worker from soliciting former clients or customers of the employer`
`ind exit fee` MEANS `an exit fee or liquidated damages provision`

