`ind non-compete, switching jobs` MEANS `ind term` `a non-compete clause` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind non-compete, starting a business` MEANS `ind term` `a non-compete clause` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind broad NDA` MEANS `ind term` `ind NDA` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind industry NDA` MEANS `ind term` `ind NDA` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind chilling NDA` MEANS `ind term` `ind NDA` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
