`ind trapping TRAP` MEANS `ind term` `ind TRAP` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind mild TRAP` MEANS `ind term` `ind TRAP` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind broad non-solicit` MEANS `ind term` `ind client non-solicit` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind narrow non-solicit` MEANS `ind term` `ind client non-solicit` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`ind trapping exit fee` MEANS `ind term` `ind exit fee` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
