-- G7 [pdf page 4]: "airplane manufacturers and their part suppliers may both hire from the
-- same market for engineers".
#ASSERT `General principles: whether the businesses compete for workers` `ind plane pair` EQUALS JUST `the businesses compete for workers in the same labor market`

