-- S1. Wage-fixing and no-poach [pdf pages 5-6]; criminal and civil [pdf pages 3, 5, 6]
-- =======================================================================================

-- S1a, C1 [pdf pages 5-6]: competing employers fix a wage.
#ASSERT `1: what the agreement is, in substance` `ind fix wages` EQUALS JUST `a wage-fixing agreement`
#ASSERT `1: the agreement is a wage-fixing or no-poach agreement` `ind fix wages`
#ASSERT `ind says` `ind s1 crime` (`1: what section 1 says of the agreement` `ind wage fixing`)
#ASSERT `ind says` `ind s1 civil` (`1: what section 1 says of the agreement` `ind wage fixing`)
#ASSERT `ind says` `ind s1 illegal even if` (`1: what section 1 says of the agreement` `ind wage fixing`)
#ASSERT `ind says` `ind s1 DOJ felony` (`1: what section 1 says of the agreement` `ind wage fixing`)
#ASSERT NOT (`ind says` `ind s1 n15` (`1: what section 1 says of the agreement` `ind wage fixing`))
